                <note rend="inline" type="source">121.5532/14: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-12-15T18:00:00-05:00">December 15, 1930—6
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>100. Your 167, December 15, 10 a.m. Blandy has now been designated as Naval
                    Attaché effective upon termination of Naval Mission about January 31.</p>
                <p>Please advise Foreign Office.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
